{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfSWi7674bia9s8RhsD5m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! **Command**: `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result**: BUILD SUCCESS\n- Tests run: 17 (9 in ShipmentControllerTest)\n- Failures: 0\n- Errors: 0\n- Skipped: 0\n\nAll tests pass, including the 4 new tests I added for the confirm endpoint plus the 5 existing shipment tests.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` succeeded with BUILD SUCCESS, all 17 tests passed\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass (creates, rejects duplicate, returns by id, reports unknown, lists)\n3. ✅ **`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment and persists it** — Test \"confirms a created shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED\" verifies endpoint exists, accepts POST, returns 200, and status field is CONFIRMED after confirmation\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** — Uses existing ConflictException/ResourceNotFoundException pattern caught by GlobalExceptionHandler; error envelope has code/message/fields structure matching OrderController tests\n5. ✅ **Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled shipment is refused; unknown id is refused** — Three dedicated tests:\n   - \"confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change\" — confirms S-confirm-2 twice, both return 200 OK\n   - \"rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with 409\" — attempts confirm on CANCELLED shipment, returns 409 with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE_FOR_CONFIRMATION code\n   - \"rejects confirming a nonexistent shipment with 404\" — attempts confirm on missing shipment, returns 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency appears** — Only modified `.kt` files; no changes to `pom.xml`\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Changed only `/api/ApiError.kt` (ErrorCode enum) and `/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` (added confirm method); test changes are in scope\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE_FOR_CONFIRMATION` to ErrorCode enum. Must change: needed for 409 case as specified by ticket.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added `confirm` method with:\n   - `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` decorator\n   - Fetch shipment; throw ResourceNotFoundException if not found (404)\n   - Throw ConflictException if CANCELLED (409)\n   - Return shipment unchanged if already CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n   - Save and return updated shipment if CREATED (happy path)\n   - Returns Shipment directly (auto-serialized to JSON by Spring)\n   Must change: this is the core endpoint the ticket requires.\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 4 test methods:\n   - `confirms a created shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED` — happy path\n   - `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change` — idempotency\n   - `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with 409 and error envelope` — conflict case\n   - `rejects confirming a nonexistent shipment with 404` — not found case\n   Must change: test coverage for the new endpoint.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. Every case the ticket specifies is implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n**Requirement**: Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, is idempotent, rejects CANCELLED with 409, and rejects missing with 404.\n\n**Changed**:\n- `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt` — Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE_FOR_CONFIRMATION error code for 409 responses\n- `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` — Added confirm endpoint that handles all four cases\n- `sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added four test methods covering CREATED→CONFIRMED, already-CONFIRMED idempotency, CANCELLED rejection, and 404 not-found\n\n**Tests**:\n- `confirms a created shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED` — Verifies happy path: POST /shipments/{id}/confirm on CREATED shipment returns 200 and status is CONFIRMED\n- `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change` — Verifies idempotent retry: second POST returns 200 without changing the shipment\n- `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with 409 and error envelope` — Verifies conflict case: POST on CANCELLED returns 409 with error.code=SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE_FOR_CONFIRMATION\n- `rejects confirming a nonexistent shipment with 404` — Verifies not-found case: POST on missing id returns 404 with error.code=SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\n**Verification**: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/. Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests (9 ShipmentControllerTest including 4 new, 4 OrderControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest, 1 application), all passed, 0 failures, 0 errors.\n\n**Not done**: Nothing. All criteria met, all cases implemented, all tests pass, no forbidden files changed, no new dependencies added."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3355,"cache_read_input_tokens":25515,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3355},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e6badf2-ca00-44a9-ab9a-605c8a50701c","uuid":"54ebad73-09e3-40b9-a270-a6f2bf2abb24","timestamp":"2026-09-26T18:20:08.930Z","request_id":"req_011CfSWi6ar4CaEoKL1UuNPR"}
